  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Health Fund focuses on the most under-served and vulnerable populations under a rights-based approach, bringing services to where they are most needed and concentrating attention on conflict-affected areas with the main purpose to improve health equity in Myanmar. At least 50% IDPs, Refugees and host communities are benefited from the Fund&#x2019;s health assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
